--- inside a standard module, the use of what the program handed is held
--- to its kinds as the program's own calls are, and the refusal names the
--- function the program called: sign's `secret` reaches `len`, and an int
--- there is refused naming sign at the program's line. (It had been llm's
--- `chat` two helpers down, and before it Magpie's `prior`, until each
--- became a package of its own.)
use web, web.auth

t = sign[map[user = 'ada'], 5]
log[t.ok]
